# URLs the link checker must not fetch (one regex per line).
#
# The ArohaLabs/aroha-protocol and ArohaLabs/aroha-spec repositories are PRIVATE for
# now: every github.com link into them (issues, discussions, advisories,
# Actions badges, tree/blob links, deploy-button clone URLs) returns 404 to an
# anonymous checker. They are the canonical future URLs and stay in the docs;
# remove these lines when the repositories go public so the links are checked.
^https://github\.com/ArohaLabs/aroha-protocol(/|$)
^https://github\.com/ArohaLabs/aroha-spec(/|$)
^https://raw\.githubusercontent\.com/ArohaLabs/
# Deploy buttons wrap the private repo URL in a query string.
^https://vercel\.com/new/clone\?repository-url=https://github\.com/ArohaLabs/
^https://deploy\.workers\.cloudflare\.com/\?url=https://github\.com/ArohaLabs/
